{"resourceIdentifier":"1686","resourceName":"Agrocortex REDD Project","description":"The primary objective of the Agrocortex REDD Project is to avoid the unplanned deforestation (AUD) of the 186,219.06 ha project area, consisting of 100% Amazon rainforest. The project area is located within a private property named “Fazenda Seringal Novo Macapá”, which is situated in the municipalities of Manoel Urbano, Pauini and Boca do Acre, in the States of Acre and Amazonas, South-western Amazon. In addition to contributing to the long-term conservation of the region, the Agrocortex REDD Project also has the function of establishing a barrier against the advancement of deforestation, making an important contribution to the conservation of South-western Amazon biodiversity and also to climate regulation in Brazil and South America.  This project is open for public comment from 12 May - 11 June 2017. No comments were received.","location":{"latitude":-8.446460,"longitude":-69.069997},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":null,"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1686"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Acre and Amazonas"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agrocortex Madeiras do Acre Agroflorestal Ltda."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"1686"},{"type":"bufferSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"1686"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"483594"}]},{"code":"TOTAL_BUFFER_POOL_CREDITS","values":[{"type":"integer","value":347924}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"REDD"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","valu